  "open_questions": [
    "Will H2 capex reach MSFT cash PP&E $83.322bn, GOOGL PP&E purchases $99.402bn, AMZN gross purchases $116.589bn and META inclusive capex $86.58bn? Late-October Q3 results and updated guides will test these run rates.",
