    "Will NVIDIA Q3 FY27 Data Center reach $103bn, and will Q4 support own $128bn versus required $129.86bn? Expected 2026-11-18 results/guide will answer; company confirmation is still needed for the date and no Q3 segment consensus was supplied.",
